[00:15.010]She lost her brother a month ago
{"她一个月前失去了哥哥"}
[00:17.870]
[00:20.570]His picture on the wall
{"墙上的照片"}
[00:22.520]
[00:23.300]And it reminds me
{"这让我想起"}
[00:25.890]
[00:28.140]When she brings me coffee,her smile
{"当她为我端来咖啡时的笑容"}
[00:32.280]
[00:34.100]I wish I could be with her until my last day
{"多希望能伴她走到生命尽头"}
[00:39.410]
[00:41.800]She said She gave all her love to me
{"她说已将全部的爱都给了我"}
[00:47.610]We dreamt a new life
{"我们曾憧憬新生活"}
[00:50.590]Some place to be at peace
{"寻找安宁的栖所"}
[00:55.390]But things changed,Suddenly
{"但一切骤变"}
[01:00.610]I lost my dreams in this disaster
{"在这场灾难中梦想尽失"}
[01:05.250]
[01:08.010]I'm crying
{"我哭泣着"}
[01:09.890]Missing my lover
{"思念我的爱人"}
[01:13.180]I don't have the power
{"我已精疲力竭"}
[01:17.430]On my side forever
{"永远站在我这边"}
[01:21.730]Oh Where is my lover
{"我的爱人在哪里"}
[01:26.870]and I got no power
{"我孤立无援"}
[01:31.970]I'm standing alone. No way
{"独自伫立 无路可退"}
[01:39.860]Calling out your name
{"呼唤你的名字"}
[01:45.670]
[02:02.740]I said I gave all my love to you
