[02:35.320]Everybody's got no place to hide
{"所有人都无处躲藏"}
[02:41.710]No one's left and there's no one to go on
{"空无一人　无人继续前行"}
[02:48.850]All I know is my life is gone
{"我只知道　我的生命已逝"}
